    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but like, is there a real difference between \"regulation\" for security and just plain old censorship? i feel like most governments use the \"security\" excuse just to shut down anything they don't like. can you look at why people say censorship is basically inevitable when states get this much power?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
